# Comments language

- Write **all** code comments, JSDoc/TSDoc, and inline `//` / `/* */` explanations in **English** only.
- User-facing copy (UI strings, i18n keys, docs for end users) may stay in the product’s locale; this rule applies to **developer comments in source code**.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD: Chinese comment in source
// 封面图 LCP 优化

// ✅ GOOD
// Cover image LCP optimization
```
